        "original_id": "ad84bdf3-5111-5a62-ad39-b976ff5978b8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dawn French, Jennifer Saunders, Adrian Edmondson, Keith Allen, Nigel Planer, Alexei Sayle, Ronald Allen, Robbie Coltrane, Al Pillay\n- Products: The Supergrass, French and Saunders, The Vicar of Dibley, Eat the Rich, The Comic Strip Presents, Gino\n- Roles: Geraldine Granger, Mary\n\nFacts:\n- Dawn French was born on 11 October 1957 and is an English actress, writer, and comedian.\n- Dawn French is best known for starring in and writing for the comedy sketch show \"French and Saunders\" with Jennifer Saunders.\n- Dawn French is also known for playing Geraldine Granger in the sitcom \"The Vicar of Dibley\".\n- Al Pillay was born on 22 August 1959 and is also known as Alan Pillay.\n- Al Pillay starred in \"Eat the Rich\".\n- In \"The Comic Strip Presents,\" Al Pillay appeared as Alan Pellay playing himself in the episode \"Gino\".\n- In \"The Comic Strip Presents,\" Al Pillay appeared as Alana Pellay playing herself in episode 13.\n- In the feature film \"The Supergrass,\" Al Pillay appeared as Lana Pellay playing Mary.\n- The film \"The Supergrass\" starred Richardson, Adrian Edmondson, Jennifer Saunders, Dawn French, Keith Allen, Nigel Planer, Alexei Sayle, Ronald Allen, and Robbie Coltrane.",
